{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>Also</b> — On account of the blood of the covenant that HaShem cut with those who went out of Egypt. And some say: on account of the commandment of circumcision, and the sense is that the Assyrians came forth from every place to join the Hasmoneans, when they prevailed over Greece."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:46:29.517256463Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}